# Local SPT/EFT install path — per-machine, gitignored as `.spt-path`.
#
# Setup: copy this file to `.spt-path` (same folder) and set the path to YOUR install.
#   cp .spt-path.example .spt-path
#
# Used by .agents/scripts/compile-mod.sh to resolve the client reference DLLs
# (BepInEx, Assembly-CSharp, Unity modules, SPT.Reflection, Fika.Core, ...) into each
# mod's modded/.../References/ folder before building.
#
# Rules:
#   - Value must be UNQUOTED.
#   - Use forward slashes, even on Windows (e.g. D:/SPT, not D:\SPT).
#   - Precedence: env $SPT_PATH / --spt-path flag > this file > default D:/SPT.
SPT_PATH=D:/SPT
